  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "By the principle of superposition of fields<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mtext>E</mtext> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>=</mo> <msub> <mrow> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mtext>E</mtext> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </mrow> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mrow> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mtext>E</mtext> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math><br /><br />Here, <math> <mrow> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mtext>E</mtext> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </mrow> </math> = net field at the centre of hole due to entire mass<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msub> <mrow> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mtext>E</mtext> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </mrow> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math> = field due to remaining mass<br /><br />and &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mrow> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mtext>E</mtext> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math> = field due to mass in hole = 0<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>E</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>GM</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>R</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>.</mtext> <mtext>r</mtext> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;where r <math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>R</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo> <mtext>E</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>GM</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <msup> <mtext>R</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>",
